{"id":"wb-6-938","name":"柳亚子旧居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"柳亚子旧居","text":"柳亚子旧居位于江苏省苏州市吴江区黎里镇，原为清工部尚书周元理的私邸。1922年，柳亚子向周氏后裔租住此宅。建筑现辟为柳亚子纪念馆，2006年列入全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9F%B3%E4%BA%9A%E5%AD%90%E6%97%A7%E5%B1%85","revisionId":92422262,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92422262","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ff413321f6941be5e659af69.jpg","title":"黎里柳亚子旧居,_2026-03-07_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%BB%8E%E9%87%8C%E6%9F%B3%E4%BA%9A%E5%AD%90%E6%97%A7%E5%B1%85,_2026-03-07_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0a/%E9%BB%8E%E9%87%8C%E6%9F%B3%E4%BA%9A%E5%AD%90%E6%97%A7%E5%B1%85%2C_2026-03-07_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​黎里柳亚子旧居","width":320,"height":214}}